  ('e2000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000733', 'ENEM-2019-004-ING', 2, 467, 'enem', 3, 2, 2019, 'multiple_choice', 'Leitura em língua inglesa', 'If children live with criticism, they learn to condemn.

